{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Long ago, people began to notice something interesting about the world around them.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.37,0.8],[0.85,1.22],[1.28,1.59],[1.65,1.7],[1.78,2.16],[2.21,2.63],[2.73,3.37],[3.45,3.73],[3.75,3.82],[3.89,4.21],[4.27,4.63],[4.69,5.34]]},{"text":"The Sun looked round. So did fruits and wheels.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.26,0.5],[0.57,0.86],[0.93,1.46],[1.71,1.88],[1.95,2.11],[2.19,2.57],[2.62,2.76],[2.84,3.67]]},{"text":"They called this round shape a circle.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.31,0.65],[0.67,0.85],[0.94,1.28],[1.36,1.71],[1.75,1.8],[1.88,2.83]]},{"text":"Then they looked at windows and tiles. They had four equal sides.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.34,0.49],[0.56,0.88],[0.93,1.03],[1.13,1.59],[1.65,1.79],[1.87,2.59],[2.91,3.15],[3.22,3.38],[3.52,3.87],[3.97,4.34],[4.43,5.29]]},{"text":"They named this shape a square.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.34,0.64],[0.66,0.85],[0.93,1.3],[1.35,1.39],[1.47,2.46]]},{"text":"Mountains and rooftops had three sides meeting at a point.","words":[[0,0.63],[0.69,0.8],[0.88,1.52],[1.57,1.73],[1.79,2.09],[2.15,2.57],[2.65,2.98],[3.05,3.16],[3.22,3.26],[3.34,4.13]]},{"text":"That shape was called a triangle.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.37,0.7],[0.74,0.87],[0.95,1.25],[1.3,1.35],[1.41,2.46]]},{"text":"Doors and books were shaped like long squares.","words":[[0,0.53],[0.59,0.73],[0.82,1.17],[1.24,1.46],[1.52,1.88],[1.93,2.15],[2.22,2.48],[2.57,3.53]]},{"text":"This shape was named a rectangle.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.35,0.69],[0.73,0.88],[0.95,1.21],[1.25,1.3],[1.38,2.46]]},{"text":"From that day on, people saw shapes everywhere — in buildings, toys, and even the sky.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.37,0.6],[0.69,0.89],[0.99,1.42],[1.66,2.02],[2.07,2.26],[2.36,2.74],[2.83,3.46],[3.54,3.59],[3.97,4.12],[4.21,4.84],[4.91,5.41],[5.43,5.57],[5.65,5.91],[5.96,6.03],[6.08,7.01]]}]}